[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_tkkh0")
sender = "Xavier {receiver}Martin | {from} Xavier my man, you said you wanted a TV? | Well, You`re in luck, I plan on selling mine on Praig`s list soon, but you can take it off my hands early if you give me that good ka-ching. {to} Hell yeah I want to buy a TV, which model is it? {from} It`s a Preuss 55\" TOS2000/4 4K LED smart TV. | It`s market price is around 8000 cloudbucks but ill give it over for 3000 since its been used. {to} It ain`t broken, is it? That`s a very large discount. {from} Nah, It`s just alittle dusty, That`s all. | I just haven`t spent as much time watching TV in the recent months, and I need this money for something else ASAP. {to} I totally get it. However, I will be taking that TV off your hands, that`s an absolute steal. {from} Nice! Send me the cash to my account number: 4102 54 3707 and come meet me at my place. {to} Will do. I`ll also send some of the cash I owe you for the previous weekend hangout. {from} Thanks! Remember: Tomorrow at 13:00 at my place. {to} Your address was Parkstreet Blvd.  | 21th house? Concrete building? With that ugly yellow mailbox? {from} You got it. See ya there. {system} Xavier Transfered 3055 Cloudbucks to account number 410253 3707 via the Card 8203 1505 6733 2359."
